<title>HONG KONG: HK provisional Sept-Nov unemployment 2.7 pct.</title>
<headline>HK provisional Sept-Nov unemployment 2.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department gave on Monday the following seasonally adjusted figures as percentages of the total workforce:</p>
<p>			Sep-Nov*  Aug-Oct   May-Jul   Aug-Oct</p>
<p>			 1996	1996	1996	1995</p>
<p> Unemployment	 2.7	 2.5**     2.9	 3.6</p>
<p> Underemployment    1.5	 1.5	 1.6	 2.3</p>
<p>* = provisional</p>
<p>** = adjusted</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
